#Context
In professional environments :
•	repetitive tasks must be automated,
•	backups must be scheduled,
•	monitoring must be periodic, and
•	logs must be generated automatically.
System administrators therefore use :
•	cron,
•	Bash scripts,
•	automated logging, and
•	scheduled tasks.


#Technical Objectives
The system must :
•	automatically perform backups,
•	run monitoring periodically,
•	log operations, and
•	validate scheduled tasks.


#Architecture Automation
| Component              | Purpose                  |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------ |
| backup.sh              | Automatic backups        |
| cleanup_old_backups.sh | Automatic cleanup        |
| monitoring scripts     | Automatic monitoring     |
| cron jobs              | Planning                 |



